cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Gated-QKANFWPs: reference implementations for Gated QKAN-FWP"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementations and training pipelines for the gated QKAN-FWP family
  of quantum-inspired Kolmogorov-Arnold Network fast-weight programmers
  (GQKAN-QKANFWP, GQKANFWP, GQKAN-FWP, GQKAN-QFWP), evaluated on three tasks:
  A3C reinforcement learning in MiniGrid, SILSO solar-cycle (sunspot)
  forecasting, and a quantum-dynamics time-series benchmark suite.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/MatthewPeng57/Gated-QKANFWPs"
keywords:
  - Kolmogorov-Arnold Networks
  - fast weight programmers
  - quantum machine learning
  - data re-uploading
  - time series forecasting
  - reinforcement learning

authors:
